- Roof: 4 apartments total (411 & 412 in 3rd Block Left, 413 & 414 in 2nd Block Left).

### 3. Database Schema (Supabase)
- Table `apartments`: `apt_number` (PK, string), `floor` (string), `block` (string), `resident_name` (string), `resident_phone` (string), `owner_name` (string), `is_rented` (boolean), `has_paid` (boolean), `updated_at` (timestamp).
- Table `transactions`: `id` (uuid), `type` ('income' | 'expense'), `amount` (number), `title` (string), `apt_number` (string nullable), `receipt_url` (string nullable), `created_at` (timestamp).

